/screencap/6a82fa8e9d58f.jpg","released":"2026-08-18T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt39229633:1:21","season":1,"episode":21,"title":"21. Combate entre vanguardias","overview":"Antes de comenzar el combate entre vanguardias, ambos equipos reciben un tutorial.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11856837/screencap/6a8c400fcb525.jpg","released":"2026-08-25T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt39229633:1:22","season":1,"episode":22,"title":"22. Trampa","overview":"Nao se da cuenta de que su equipo se dirige a una trampa que puede hacerles perder el primer juego.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11856838/screencap/6a958a6f356a9.jpg","released":"2026-09-01T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt39229633:1:23","season":1,"episode":23,"title":"23. Batalla de miembros base","overview":"Antes de la batalla, el encargado les explica las reglas a ambos equipos y hacen una prueba.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11856839/screencap/6a9ed936a36cc.jpg","released":"2026-09-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt39229633:1:24","season":1,"episode":24,"title":"24. Contrataque","overview":"Aunque Akiyama está contra las cuerdas, no se rendirá fácilmente contra Kikuchi.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11856840/screencap/6aa815361c41b.jpg","released":"2026-09-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt39229633:1:25","season":1,"episode":25,"title":"25. Combate entre generales","overview":"Antes de comenzar la última batalla, ambos ejércitos juegan una ronda de prueba al último juego.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11958258/screencap/6ab125440e2e2.jpg","released":"2026-09-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt39229633:1:26","season":1,"episode":26,"title":"26. Decisión","overview":"Las dos generales despliegan sus trucos para superar al otro ejército y ganar el juego.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.th